{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "55c659bf9f533dd461a2aea0d3a68c28f0914be979b1f0090c148f9158ef5e8d", "ja": "お悩み相談『人に一癖？』", "zh": "烦恼咨询“人各有个性？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "08f24cd43ed0484ff34270f844788685734234203b3276d259ffe17bee56c382", "ja": "「彼氏の変わったクセに困っている」という\n悩める女子の相談に答える4人は、\nそれぞれ自分達の考えを口にしていく。\nそしてドラマ『セレブレーション！』の時の\n話題になり、番組は盛り上がっていく。", "zh": "面对为“男友古怪的怪癖而烦恼”的\n苦恼女生的咨询，4人各自\n说出了自己的想法。\n随后话题转到了拍摄电视剧《Celebration！》的时候，\n节目现场的气氛也愈发热烈起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac1ec5eaa568e4bbf733de11be069dc10cf67bf684821637805e8931b79d45b0", "ja": "事前にお悩みを募集してたのよね。\n麗花ちゃん、お便りを読んでもらってもいいかしら？", "zh": "之前征集过烦恼咨询，对吧。\n丽花，可以请你读一下来信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "f8d28cfd489dd2b5b741ef1f474032822d4cf21d274423335c5ef6ec8a12b032", "ja": "はい、わかりました。えっと……\nペンネーム、みこぽんさんからいただいたお悩みです。", "zh": "好的，我知道了。那个……\n这是笔名为“みこぽん”的来信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7449bbe2eff327e43215f8c007784ec86cf15c29fff4d4c7039cd650228e2e22", "ja": "「4 Luxuryのみなさん、初めまして！\n突然ですが、私の悩みを聞いてください」", "zh": "“4 Luxury的各位，初次见面！\n虽然有些突兀，但请听听我的烦恼”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "f3cf1f92572615116eb3d7e5e2fd150bfdeb092f8e0e94e4dc782b3e63f884be", "ja": "「悩みというのは、私の彼氏のことです。\n彼には、変わったクセがあるんです。それは……」", "zh": "所谓的烦恼，就是关于我男朋友的事。\n他有个奇怪的癖好。那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "873860baa872d50efc085637524c1a18dbcae454997874dc6cd82456f5d681ec", "ja": "「ヒゲを抜いてティッシュに植える癖です」", "zh": "「把胡子拔下来种在纸巾上的习惯」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "90244f9c5c5a5bf6ffa4ad9aa3bbd17691a4b8c9c6da1204fdfec4076f9135a1", "ja": "えっ？（まあ……）", "zh": "诶？（嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "413d0f298bb1359ee27dc8980a4f893dbbf7649aba97d5db1eb1febb84625b05", "ja": "まあ……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "0cbb9324041c11e91468db0b492c45df5601056e62249a6d85c59f3179a10de7", "ja": "「正直、別れようと思ったこともあります。\n私はこのまま、付き合っていてもいいのでしょうか？」", "zh": "“说实话，我也曾想过要分手。\n我这样继续交往下去，真的好吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "73fd3c37bc25330c7d08f18aca897c2d2a42c2bfd29bafcfafc1ce70553fe8e9", "ja": "なるほど。個性的な彼氏について悩んでるのね。\n難しいお悩みだけど……風花ちゃんは、どう思う？", "zh": "原来如此。你是在为个性十足的男朋友烦恼啊。\n虽然是个棘手的问题……风花，你怎么看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e20781747b66cd472200f3d276c4d1f318744e84c2968e9220fa44dfd891ac9e", "ja": "そ、そうですね。お話を聞いて思ったのは、\nみこぽんさんのことをすごく信頼してるんだなって。", "zh": "是、是这样。听了你的诉说，我觉得你真的很信任咪可朋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1a45c2f66c58a289d8910de49cf73a743ccf942cc6d61f55b76f6427cb89f5c2", "ja": "普段の自分を見せてもいいって、思われてるのかも。\nなんだか素敵な関係ですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "也许是觉得可以在对方面前展示真实的自己吧。\n感觉是很美好的关系呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "16f5e85b4006f949fba4f062c7266835ded542d62fc7a0aeef04713b40e2f4e8", "ja": "ふむふむ。確かに、そうかもしれないわね。\nそれじゃ、麗花ちゃんは？", "zh": "嗯嗯。确实，也许是这样呢。\n那么，丽花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "936a6e5a3b578a7af02376fd6dda427ff5b6921c7bdddb155681ef1e0e263da8", "ja": "うーん……\n彼氏さんは器用な人なんだなーって思いました！", "zh": "嗯——……\n我觉得那位男朋友先生真是个能干的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "2cc2efbec2270ef98382952f11cf9637aa63563b91e26f9633146e4fda376bb7", "ja": "えっ？　今のお便りで？", "zh": "咦？就凭刚才那封来信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "3948f88dddac3207b13c32af86860264e7a5eede9f8a6faec8787dcfcac83f4f", "ja": "はい！　だって、すごく繊細な作業だから、\n手先が器用じゃないと難しいんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "是的！因为那是非常精细的工作嘛，我觉得如果手不够灵巧，应该很难做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "e64ff3aaf6af211f77301d6cc2ea55182959318fa5676a2791f390e45604e788", "ja": "……まあ、そういう見方もあるわね。\n歌織ちゃんは、どう？", "zh": "……嗯，也是有这种看法呢。\n歌织，你怎么看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b590e13720ea62d76e44a60a6540704a66cd1ca615fbf487078f6bf737660f3", "ja": "そうね。みこぽんさん自身の気持ちが大事じゃないかし\nら。心のどこかに、別れたくない理由があるのかも。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得，Mikopon小姐自己的想法才是最重要的。她心里的某个角落，或许有着不想分手的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "79e8a4d2811e0acce354c96ada5d2726090fc5c45956ef30121b31ea75126308", "ja": "だから、実行には移せなかったのかなって。落ち着いて\n考えてみたら、何か気づくことがあるかもしれないわ。", "zh": "所以，我想你也许没能付诸行动吧。冷静下来想想，说不定会发现些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "d21e0a884accbd44fa1cbf70bcff4f6790453d8944106b47ad6d24cce1e9bb8e", "ja": "そうね。もし不安があるなら、\n彼と話をしてみるのも手かもしれないわね。", "zh": "是啊。如果感到不安的话，和他谈谈或许也是个办法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ab31470f0c63d12002e6762d0076ad53d5e14816b1e82a032fa9deaeb28aa34", "ja": "お互いの気持ちがわかれば、次の答えも見えるはずよ。\n私たちが応援するから、頑張って！", "zh": "只要了解彼此的心情，答案应该也会随之浮现。\n我们会为你加油的，所以加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "5f30bb63071bce8efd0cc2d9200e6b572d8b502149026c50dc6f1bcd77dbc04e", "ja": "それにしても、不思議ね。\n自分のクセって、自分ではよくわからないでしょう？", "zh": "不过话说回来，真不可思议呢。\n自己的习惯，自己也很难察觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "c24470665bfd17d5d292acc649ac4d8e163921416dead8a460dbc1334217a22b", "ja": "私たちも、ドラマの撮影のためにルームシェアをして、\n初めてわかったことがたくさんありましたよね♪", "zh": "我们也是，为了拍摄剧集而合住之后，\n才发现了好多之前不知道的事情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "ef09909ea08e8594d4cd4b001cd136a7808d0843d4d7bf857ae8b3f5d01b5740", "ja": "朝の歌織さんと、夜の歌織さんには\n私もビックリしちゃいました♪", "zh": "早上的歌织和晚上的歌织，\n把我也吓了一跳呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "0c2f378236eab3ab2e6dfb53fda075fe7e77feb2a5632384efec64afd8c1d0a5", "ja": "ストップ！　そこまでよ麗花ちゃん。\nその話は忘れることに決まったでしょう！", "zh": "住手！丽花，别再说了。\n不是已经决定忘掉那件事了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "bb42f4852eec296a13623b699fded38714e27a1e5d8aea78fd2d668bbd1fe08b", "ja": "えっ……？　あ、あの、何のこと？\nもしかして私、何かしちゃったの！？", "zh": "咦……？那、那个，什么事？\n难道我做了什么吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "bc2a78d85cb3408ac3e8b9a57bbd2cf5c7976cd4503889888e5c068bad1efd1f", "ja": "大丈夫よ、歌織ちゃん。うん、全然大丈夫！\nカメラの前ではちょっとアレなだけよ♪", "zh": "没事的啦，歌织。嗯，完全没事！\n只是在镜头前有点那个而已啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "4ffe6e51a9441fc7fa1320ed4b6ed1200b7587044e0e3992adac8771d8b0eab8", "ja": "ええっ……！！", "zh": "诶诶……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_02_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "7cd798b4b5d66b87e798f7517c78b5f671942652f7d6acab76caef0f47a85e03", "ja": "その話は、またいつかね。\nひとまず次の話題に移りましょうか！", "zh": "那件事，改天再说吧。\n我们先换个话题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
